WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.261
Job four: connect your team to the rest of Vanderbilt.

2
00:00:05.311 --> 00:00:12.947
Your team needs things it does not control: approvals, information, help from other offices.

3
00:00:12.997 --> 00:00:19.798
Three habits. Know the people your team depends on, by name, before you need them.

4
00:00:19.848 --> 00:00:25.061
Watch for what is coming, so your team hears it from you first.

5
00:00:25.111 --> 00:00:31.577
Speak up for your team: show the hours, offer two options, negotiate the date.

6
00:00:31.627 --> 00:00:36.590
This week, have coffee with one person your team depends on.

